# Held landings (look A, on the walls): every 10th landing the army has cleared can be held by a
# crowd of plain pets sent by shelf. An empty landing only has a dashed '0/500' pill right of the
# shaft; tapping it puts its card where "last time" sits: "landing 10", how many, "holding the rope",
# a meter, a ‹ n › per shelf with pets that may go and "hold on tight!". While it fills the pill is a
# dashed 'N/M'; once it's full, a coral 'N' and a pennant on the card. The crowds: around the rope at
# 10, propping the door at 20 (the pill under the landing, clear of the sewing room's door), sitting
# on the stairs at 30 (its guard is gone). Then the orders card gets "start from": the army starts at
# landing 30 and skips the floors above. Everything stays inside the window.
from rich
view full
herd common normal 30000
herd uncommon normal 9000
herd rare normal 400
herd epic normal 300
herd legendary normal 200
herd mythic normal 100
unlock page:beyond
unlock location:well
dungeon
wait popup
click "lovely"
deep 32
wait popup                           # past floor 10: your pet can lead the army
click "lovely"
card body=fox rarity=mythic finish=prismatic 20   # strong enough for floor 31
tab adventures
page adventures 2
wait 1
army best
army-herd common 280
wait 1
expect text "the old well"
expect no-text "start from"          # nothing held yet
expect fits
shot spots                           # the empty landings: dashed pills only
click HoldSpot#1
wait 0.5
expect text "landing 10"
expect text "holding the rope"
expect text "hold on tight!"
expect text "/ 500"
expect fits
shot empty_card
hold-pick rare 50                    # the rare shelf's stepper at 50
wait 0.3
expect text "50"
expect fits
shot picked
hold-scroll 30                       # six shelves: the list scrolls
hold-pick uncommon 25
wait 1.2
hold-scrolled 30                     # a step (and the page's checks) keep it where it was
expect fits
shot picked_scrolled
hold-pick uncommon 0
click "hold on tight!"
wait 0.5
expect text "/ 500"
holders 10 common 150
wait 0.5
expect text "200"
expect fits
shot filling                         # a dashed 200/500 pill, a small crowd on the rope
holders 10 common 1000
wait 0.5
expect text "500"
expect no-text "hold on tight!"
expect fits
shot rope_held                       # a coral 500 pill, the card's pennant
holders 20 common 1200
holders 30 common 6000
holders 30 uncommon 3000
wait 0.5
click HoldSpot#2
wait 0.5
expect text "landing 20"
expect text "holding the door"
expect text "/ 2k"
expect fits
shot door_filling                    # 1.2k/2k under the landing, the crowd beside the door
holders 20 common 800
find little_key                      # the sewing room's door: the pill stays clear of it
wait 1
click HoldSpot#2
wait 0.5
expect text "holding the door"
expect fits
shot door_held                       # the door propped open, the pill under the landing
click HoldSpot#3
wait 0.5
expect text "landing 30"
expect text "holding the stairs"
expect fits
shot stairs_held                     # sitting on the stairs, no guard
click "✕"
wait 0.5
expect text "start from"
expect text "the top"
start 30
wait 0.5
expect text "landing 30"
expect text "31"
expect fits
shot start_from
down
wait 2
expect text "on the way…"
expect fits
shot running                         # the army pops out at landing 30
down-done
wait 1
expect text "last time"
expect text "floor 3*"
expect fits
shot home
